# Open the gripper in place — zero arm motion. Because the TG-9801 RS485
# position reads are invalid on this arm, the response never claims the
# opening was verified; observe the fingers.
#
# Request has no fields — the tool takes no arguments ({}).
---
# Whether the release command was issued.
bool success

# Human-readable status. On failure, names the failing stage
# (preflight / release/open).
string message

# How long the whole call took (s).
float32 elapsed_s
